          <li class="pl-1">
            <p><strong>New College:</strong> One of the most beautiful university buildings in Edinburgh, New College is well worth stopping by for a few photos. Its impressive Gothic architecture, towers and historic courtyard make it one of the city’s most striking spots.</p>
            <ArticleImage
